Package: devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-tearfree-plasma
Version: 1.4-6
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Recommends: xlibre
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Let the X server handle vsync for KWin
 Disables sync to vblank in KWin and Qt Quick on X11, so the modesetting
 driver of XLibre (or a recent unreleased Xorg) handles vsync and
 TearFree instead.
